<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include '_theme_head.html.j2' %}
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Currency Strength | Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  {% include '_navbar.html.j2' %}

  <main class="page-content strength-page">
    <header class="strength-header">
      <h1>Currency Strength</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="econ-legend">
      <span class="muted">A currency's score = the mean of the fundamental scores of the 7 pairs on
      <a href="/economic">Economic</a> it belongs to (+ as base, − as quote), without COT and without trend.
      It is in pair units, so the bias uses the same thresholds as the pairs, and the 8 scores sum to 0.
      Monetary enters a pair as the 2Y spread, only when both currencies have a fresh 2Y yield; the card
      shows each currency's own 2Y for information. Position (arc + %) = 50 + score × K. Click a card or
      table row for the per-indicator drilldown.</span>
    </div>
    {% include '_help_scoring_modal.html.j2' %}

    <div id="strengthMain">
      <p class="model-note" id="modelNote" hidden></p>
      <p class="strength-divergence" id="strengthDivergence"></p>
      <p class="strength-context">Divergence = strongest − weakest score. A small spread = no exploitable
      macro divergence. N (the currency's indicators) is informative: each pair compares only the
      categories both currencies have.</p>

      <div class="strength-grid" id="strengthGrid">
        <p class="muted" style="grid-column: 1/-1; text-align:center; padding: 30px;">Loading…</p>
      </div>

      <section class="strength-table-wrap">
        <h2>Sorted</h2>
        <div class="retail-table-scroll">
          <table class="retail-table strength-table" id="strengthTable">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Currency</th><th>%</th><th>Score</th><th>Bias</th><th>N</th><th>Own 2Y</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="strengthTableBody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="strength-matrix-wrap">
        <h2>Divergence matrix</h2>
        <p class="strength-context" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Rows = base currency, columns = quoted currency.
        Cell = fundamental score of the pair row/column (as on Economic, without COT and trend).
        Currencies with no coverage are excluded from the matrix entirely.</p>
        <div class="strength-matrix-scroll">
          <table class="strength-matrix" id="strengthMatrix"></table>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="strength-drilldown" id="strengthDrilldown" hidden>
      <button type="button" class="strength-back" id="strengthBack">&larr; All currencies</button>
      <div id="strengthDrilldownContent"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>window.ECON_DATA_URL = "{{ data_url }}";</script>
  <script src="/strength.js"></script>
  <script src="/help-scoring.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
